sequenceDiagram
  actor C as Customer
  participant S as Supervisor
  participant D as SimDeviceAgent
  participant G as ToolGateway
  participant N as Notification (SMS)
  participant OP as Human operator
  C->>S: I need a SIM replacement, ICCID ...
  S->>D: handle
  D->>G: sim.replace
  G->>G: session is basic_pin, action needs MFA
  G-->>C: STEP_UP_REQUIRED
  G->>N: send OTP to registered number
  C->>S: 6-digit code
  S->>S: verify code, lift session, resume saved request
  G-->>C: Confirm SIM replacement?
  C->>S: YES
  G->>G: status AWAITING_APPROVAL
  G-->>OP: Approval queue
  G-->>C: Needs approval from a specialist
  OP->>G: approve (operator-only endpoint)
  G->>G: execute and audit
  Note over G: 3 wrong codes lock step-up and escalate to a human
